A nitrile-based rubber and a nitrile-based rubber composition were prepared in the same manner as in Example 1, except that 1.0 part by weight of a mixture, in which a fatty acid (
CAS No. 67701-19-3
) comprising a dimer acid and potassium oleate (
CAS No. 143-18-0
) were mixed at a weight ratio of 8 : 2, as an emulsifier was introduced thereinto, and the reaction time was 7.5 hours.

A nitrile-based rubber and a nitrile-based rubber composition were prepared in the same manner as in Example 1, except that 1.5 parts by weight of a mixture, in which a fatty acid (
CAS No. 67701-19-3
) comprising a dimer acid and potassium oleate (
CAS No. 143-18-0
) were mixed at a weight ratio of 8 : 2, as an emulsifier were introduced thereinto, and the reaction time was 7.5 hours.

A nitrile-based rubber and a nitrile-based rubber composition were prepared in the same manner as in Example 1, except that 2.0 parts by weight of a mixture, in which a fatty acid (
CAS No. 67701-19-3
) comprising a dimer acid and potassium oleate (
CAS No. 143-18-0
) were mixed at a weight ratio of 8 : 2, as an emulsifier were introduced thereinto, and the reaction time was 7.5 hours.
